# Deny the build context by default, then admit what the stage copies.
# `COPY . /tests` is context-wide, so every scorer input must be admitted here or the
# verifier image ships without the scorer and cannot grade at all.
*
!baseline_manifest.json
!cheat-checks.json
!group_map.json
!judge.toml
!requirements.lock.txt
!reward.toml
!sets.json
!test.sh
!test_output.py
